    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Heritage",
     "texto": [
      "**Patrimoniu cultural** means \"cultural heritage\". **Cetate** is a historic fortress; it is not the false friend \"city\"."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Description",
     "texto": [
      "**Veche** agrees with a feminine noun; **vechi**, with a masculine one. **Datează din** indicates since when something exists."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
